OL,3,GNEWSA'Monster' raped one girl and
OL,4,Amolested another
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "monster" who raped one girl and
OL,7,Fmolested another has been jailed for 17
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FLiam Fox's offences against his first
OL,11,Fyoung victim came to light after the
OL,12,Fsecond reported him, Teesside Crown
OL,13,FCourt heard.
OL,15,FHis victims said the abuse had
OL,16,Fdevastated their young lives, with one
OL,17,Fsaying he "took everything away"
OL,18,Fincluding her childhood, body and "part
OL,19,Fof my soul".
